docs/doc-M.md:104:**Hypothesis.** Starting only with the given source and the rules above yields a kernel that passes all gates, avoids global quadratic temporaries, and at `(N,D)=(2048,64),(4096,64)` on one GB10 beats unfused time and DRAM traffic while approaching an independently coded block fold. The comparison is against hand-written **f32 streaming**, not a vendor low-precision tensor-core path.
